{"id":"c16c3dd943e2288c","group":"56","path":"56/56-df-left-normal.md","title":"左正规","display":"df-left-normal — 左正规","type":"definition","metadata":{"book":"Term Rewriting Systems (Terese, 2003)","book_abbrev":"56","type":"definition","label":"56-df-left-normal","aliases":["56-df-left-normal"],"display":"df-left-normal — 左正规","depends_on":["[[56-df-orthogonal]]","[[56-df-position]]","[[56-df-subterm]]","[[56-df-rewrite-system]]"],"source_section":"§4.9 Definition 4.9.8","source_printed_pages":"133","source_ocr_blocks":[154],"source_verification":"原书OCR文本陈述已逐项比对；证明核验范围见Remark"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"book","html":"Term Rewriting Systems (Terese, 2003)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"56"},{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"label","html":"56-df-left-normal"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>56-df-left-normal</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-left-normal — 左正规"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"34fb9d07dfbad48c\" href=\"?note=34fb9d07dfbad48c\" title=\"56-df-orthogonal\">56-df-orthogonal</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"da02033e6d596cae\" href=\"?note=da02033e6d596cae\" title=\"56-df-position\">56-df-position</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"c3157a722a0edf96\" href=\"?note=c3157a722a0edf96\" title=\"56-df-subterm\">56-df-subterm</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"a6c29a8d098ef0ed\" href=\"?note=a6c29a8d098ef0ed\" title=\"56-df-rewrite-system\">56-df-rewrite-system</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_section","html":"§4.9 Definition 4.9.8"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"133"},{"key":"source_ocr_blocks","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>154</span></div>"},{"key":"source_verification","html":"原书OCR文本陈述已逐项比对；证明核验范围见Remark"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma=(F,\\mathrm{ar})\">\\(\\Sigma=(F,\\mathrm{ar})\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"V\">\\(V\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T=\\mathcal T(\\Sigma,V)\">\\(T=\\mathcal T(\\Sigma,V)\\)</span> 和规则集 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"R\">\\(R\\)</span> 满足 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{TRS}(\\Sigma,V,R)\">\\(\\mathrm{TRS}(\\Sigma,V,R)\\)</span>，见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"a6c29a8d098ef0ed\" href=\"?note=a6c29a8d098ef0ed\" title=\"56-df-rewrite-system\">56-df-rewrite-system</a>；这里 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"F,V\">\\(F,V\\)</span> 分别实例化上游的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal F,\\mathcal V\">\\(\\mathcal F,\\mathcal V\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Orthogonal}\">\\(\\mathrm{Orthogonal}\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"34fb9d07dfbad48c\" href=\"?note=34fb9d07dfbad48c\" title=\"56-df-orthogonal\">56-df-orthogonal</a>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"&lt;_{\\mathrm{lex}}\">\\(&lt;_{\\mathrm{lex}}\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"da02033e6d596cae\" href=\"?note=da02033e6d596cae\" title=\"56-df-position\">56-df-position</a>，子项见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"c3157a722a0edf96\" href=\"?note=c3157a722a0edf96\" title=\"56-df-subterm\">56-df-subterm</a>。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{LeftNormal}(\\Sigma,V,R)\\;\\Longleftrightarrow\\;\n\\mathrm{Orthogonal}(\\Sigma,V,R)\\land\n\\forall(l,r)\\in R\\;\\forall p,q\\in\\mathrm{Pos}(l)\\;\n((l|_p\\notin V\\land l|_q\\in V)\\Longrightarrow p&lt;_{\\mathrm{lex}}q).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{LeftNormal}(\\Sigma,V,R)\\;\\Longleftrightarrow\\;\n\\mathrm{Orthogonal}(\\Sigma,V,R)\\land\n\\forall(l,r)\\in R\\;\\forall p,q\\in\\mathrm{Pos}(l)\\;\n((l|_p\\notin V\\land l|_q\\in V)\\Longrightarrow p&lt;_{\\mathrm{lex}}q).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>本书此处在正交TRS内定义left-normal：每个左端中所有函数/常元符号都在线性前序记法中先于变量。因为非变量子项的根正是函数符号，公式与此条件对应。第8章有更广泛背景，本原子保持§4.9版本。</p>\n<p>来源定位中的 <code>source_ocr_blocks</code> 指本地提取文本的页块序号，不宣称是DjVu物理页码；印刷页已按该页页眉或页脚核对。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"56-df-orthogonal","status":"resolved","id":"34fb9d07dfbad48c","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[56-df-orthogonal]]","embed":false},{"target":"56-df-position","status":"resolved","id":"da02033e6d596cae","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[56-df-position]]","embed":false},{"target":"56-df-subterm","status":"resolved","id":"c3157a722a0edf96","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[56-df-subterm]]","embed":false},{"target":"56-df-rewrite-system","status":"resolved","id":"a6c29a8d098ef0ed","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[56-df-rewrite-system]]","embed":false},{"target":"56-df-rewrite-system","status":"resolved","id":"a6c29a8d098ef0ed","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\Sigma=(F,\\mathrm{ar})$、$V$、$T=\\mathcal T(\\Sigma,V)$ 和规则集 $R$ 满足 $\\mathrm{TRS}(\\Sigma,V,R)$，见 [[56-df-rewrite-system]]；这里 $F,V$ 分别实例化上游的 $\\mathcal F,\\mathcal V$。","embed":false},{"target":"56-df-orthogonal","status":"resolved","id":"34fb9d07dfbad48c","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Orthogonal}$ 见 [[56-df-orthogonal]]；$<_{\\mathrm{lex}}$ 见 [[56-df-position]]，子项见 [[56-df-subterm]]。","embed":false},{"target":"56-df-position","status":"resolved","id":"da02033e6d596cae","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Orthogonal}$ 见 [[56-df-orthogonal]]；$<_{\\mathrm{lex}}$ 见 [[56-df-position]]，子项见 [[56-df-subterm]]。","embed":false},{"target":"56-df-subterm","status":"resolved","id":"c3157a722a0edf96","anchor":"ref-8","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Orthogonal}$ 见 [[56-df-orthogonal]]；$<_{\\mathrm{lex}}$ 见 [[56-df-position]]，子项见 [[56-df-subterm]]。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\Sigma=(F,\\mathrm{ar})","display":false},{"tex":"V","display":false},{"tex":"T=\\mathcal T(\\Sigma,V)","display":false},{"tex":"R","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{TRS}(\\Sigma,V,R)","display":false},{"tex":"F,V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal F,\\mathcal V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Orthogonal}","display":false},{"tex":"<_{\\mathrm{lex}}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{LeftNormal}(\\Sigma,V,R)\\;\\Longleftrightarrow\\;\n\\mathrm{Orthogonal}(\\Sigma,V,R)\\land\n\\forall(l,r)\\in R\\;\\forall p,q\\in\\mathrm{Pos}(l)\\;\n((l|_p\\notin V\\land l|_q\\in V)\\Longrightarrow p<_{\\mathrm{lex}}q).","display":true}],"bytes":1540,"backlinks":[{"id":"bd57a306fd3547e4","anchor":"ref-14","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$V$ 为与函数符号集不交的可数无限变量集，$x\\in V$，$T=\\mathcal T(\\Sigma,V)$ 见 [[56-df-terms]]。重写、策略、左正规性与函数迭代见 [[56-df-rewrite-relation]]、[[56-df-normal-order]]、[[56-df-left-normal]]、[[56-df-normalizing-strategy]]、[[56-df-reduction-strategy]]。"},{"id":"7a89e84aacc9537c","anchor":"ref-180","locations":["正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"[[56-df-left-normal.md]]"},{"id":"087a1cdc8995ba56","anchor":"ref-14","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{LeftNormal}(\\Sigma,V,R)$ 见 [[56-df-left-normal]]，它含正交性；$\\mathrm{NO}_{\\Sigma,V,R}$ 见 [[56-df-normal-order]]，正规化策略见 [[56-df-normalizing-strategy]]。"}],"outgoing":["34fb9d07dfbad48c","da02033e6d596cae","c3157a7